      "Module(body=[Assign(targets=[Name(id='x', ctx=Store())], value=BinOp(left=BinOp(left=Constant(value=1), op=Add(), right=BinOp(left=Constant(value=2), op=Mult(), right=Constant(value=3))), op=Sub(), right=UnaryOp(op=USub(), operand=Constant(value=4))))], type_ignores=[])")
